00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
I'm Amalraj Rajesh,
from Basepan Space Challenge Team.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,500
Challenge: Harmonization of MODIS
and VIIRS Hot Spots.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:12,000
MODIS is retiring; more than a decade
of fire history could be lost.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,500
NL Fire Calendar: twenty-five years
of fire history on one scale.

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:22,000
Fire cells and one ratio from fourteen
overlap seasons scale MODIS to VIIRS.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,500
Data: NASA FIRMS and CSA MOPITT.

7
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,500
Pick an area and month
for historical context.

